                <pb facs="0291" n="211" sameAs="frus:frus1901/pg211"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure.]</seg></opener>
                <p rendition="#center">[Senate Resolution No. 480, Fifty-sixth Congress, second
                    session.]</p>
                <p>Mr. Allison submitted the following resolution:</p>
                <p><hi rendition="#italic">Resolved</hi>, That the death of Her Royal and Imperial
                    Majesty, Victoria, of noble virtues and great renown, is sincerely deplored by
                    the Senate of the United States of America.</p>
                <p><hi rendition="#italic">Resolved</hi>, That the President pro tempore of the
                    Senate cause to be conveyed to the prime minister of Great Britain a suitably
                    engrossed and duly authenticated copy of the foregoing resolution.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
